OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHazy sunshine at first this
OL,6,Fmorning. Turning increasingly cloudy
OL,7,Ffrom the southwest with rain to
OL,8,Ffollow. Persistent and heavy at times
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon. Feeling
OL,10,Funpleasant with strong winds and gales
OL,11,Ftowards coasts and over hills later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMilder tonight with rain
OL,14,Feasing. Turning drier for a time
OL,15,Fbefore blustery showers feed in
OL,16,Fthrough the early hours, heavy at
OL,17,Ftimes. Strong winds persist along the
OL,18,Fcoast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
