OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FFrequent blustery showers
OL,6,Fpersist on Tuesday, heavy and perhaps
OL,7,Fthundery at times. Some brighter
OL,8,Fspells may develop later.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,11,Fchangeable few days ahead, turning
OL,12,Fcolder with blustery showers on
OL,13,FWednesday. Further outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fon Thursday, before winds ease and
OL,15,Fbrighter spells return on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
